        <briefdescription>
<para>Load all previously persisted schedules into <computeroutput>schedules</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Scans the &quot;maint_sched::&quot; prefix using IStorageEngine::scanPrefix(). For each entry: • Valid JSON → deserialised and inserted into <computeroutput>schedules</computeroutput>. • Corrupt / unparseable JSON → WARN log, entry skipped.</para>
<para>Existing contents of <computeroutput>schedules</computeroutput> are not cleared; loaded entries are merged (overwrite on id collision).</para>
